Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; explorer7_install.reg
;
; Enables the Application Verifier hook on explorer.exe so explorer7.dll loads at
; DLL_PROCESS_VERIFIER and swaps the Windows 7 explorer image in place.
;
; Prerequisites (run as Administrator):
;   1. Build explorer7.dll and copy it to %windir%\System32.
;   2. Win7 x64 explorer.exe at C:\explorer7\explorer.exe, with its MUI at
;      C:\explorer7\en-US\explorer.exe.mui (the loader redirects MUI opens there;
;      a .mui is checksum-bound to its binary, so the Win10 one fails against it).
;   3. The Explorer7 wrapper wrp64.dll where explorer will find it (%windir%
;      and/or %windir%\System32).
;
; GlobalFlag = 0x100 (FLG_APPLICATION_VERIFIER) is used ONLY for its timing:
; DLL_PROCESS_VERIFIER is the one hook point that runs before the loader snaps
; the main image's imports. explorer7.dll disarms the verifier itself at
; DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH by clearing PEB->NtGlobalFlag & 0x100.
;
; VerifierFlags MUST BE NONZERO -- this one is easy to get wrong.
;   ntdll honours this value only when it is nonzero. Leaving it absent, or
;   setting it to 0, keeps the hardcoded default 0x48004, whose 0x8000 bit makes
;   AVrfpEnableHeapVerifier switch on light PAGE HEAP (NtGlobalFlag 0x02000000).
;   Page heap captures a full stack backtrace on EVERY heap alloc/free: measured
;   at ~28% of explorer's CPU and ~110-140 ms per Explorer window.
;   0x40004 is the default with the page-heap bit removed.
;   (Note the disarm above does NOT cover this -- page heap runs off a different
;   NtGlobalFlag bit than the verifier bit.)
;
; MitigationOptions bits 40-43 = 2 = CONTROL_FLOW_GUARD ALWAYS_OFF. Required:
;   the process is created from the CFG-enabled Win10 binary, so without this the
;   swapped-in Win7 code fast-fails at msvcrt!initterm (RtlFailFast2, rcx=0xA).
;   The loader's runtime NtSetInformationVirtualMemory CFG marking is NOT enough.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\Image File Execution Options\explorer.exe]
"GlobalFlag"=dword:00000100
"VerifierDlls"="explorer7"
"Explorer7Path"="C:\\explorer7"
"VerifierFlags"=dword:00040004
"MitigationOptions"=hex(b):00,00,00,00,00,02,00,00
